<title>UK: EIB sets 10 billion peseta bond due Jan 2008.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 10 billion peseta bond due Jan 2008.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    31.JAN.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.528    PAY DATE   S28.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.875     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
